+# N1 v2 study-controller report
+
+Date: 16 September 2026
+Scope: unchanged-carrier capture intake, separated receiver orchestration, coupon calibration, coverage and decision accounting
+Current scientific state: **pending physical inputs**
+
+## Outcome first
