+
+No automatic mask retuning follows this result. A possible future, separately preregistered development question remains: **what row-independent, source-only eligibility rule can handle sparse pages without recipient-score feedback while preserving an analyzable conditional null?**
+
+## Claim boundary
+
+This pilot supports neither production promotion nor a claim of soft-receiver superiority. The prospective capture abstained and therefore does not establish physical recovery. The one historical development recovery remains development-only. A recovered visual pattern cannot inherit digital-PDF structure, immutable-ledger, content-authenticity, non-framing, or human-culpability claims.
